		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORML 「For example, the notion of morality changes with time and culture.」
		PRINTFORML 「Society now accepts that even if a woman gives up her virginity, it is okay if she keeps her heart pure for her future husband.」
		PRINTFORMW 「The morality of a woman today is no longer the morality of a woman in feudal times.」
		PRINTFORML 
