		PRINTFORMW 
		PRINTFORMW 「You understand what it means to be judged by me, yes? You would also do well to heed this warning.」
	CASE 3
		PRINTFORMW 「Let's see... What do you know about the "Jeweled Pagoda"?」
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORML 「...It's not something one can easily drop or lose somewhere. Please just forget about that.」
		PRINTFORMW 「As a representative of Bishamonten, that girl should really treat it with more care...」
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORML 「...This is all beside the point, so let's continue.」
		PRINTFORML 「The "Jeweled Pagoda" I speak of is more of a valuable tool, a type of container.」
