		PRINTFORML 「The mind thinks and discerns, and the heart is the source of all emotions.」
		PRINTFORML 「The stomach supplies and stores, and gives life and function to the arms and legs.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Together, all the parts of the body work in harmony to perform various complex tasks.」
		PRINTFORML 
