		PRINTFORML 「Without this knowledge, one can easily mistake evil deeds for good, and vice versa.」
		PRINTFORML 「And without understanding the relationship between cause and effect, one's efforts will be in vain and lead only to frustration.」
		PRINTFORML 「Daikon will never grow from watermelon seeds, but there will always be those who claim this to be the case.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Those without proper knowledge will surely err in this way.」
		PRINTFORML 
		PRINTFORML 「Therefore, you must not tarry in your pursuit of knowledge.」
		PRINTFORML 「Always seek to deepen your understanding of yourself, the matters you are involved in, and those that are close to you.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Then even in the face of unknown "karma", you will always know the correct thing to do.」
ENDSELECT
