			PRINTFORMDW Her hand carrying the Rod of Remorse is shaking. It seems you've struck a nerve...
			PRINTFORML 「...If that's how you're going to act, it's all the same to me.」
			PRINTFORML 「You've simply missed the opportunity to atone. Some day, your sins will catch up to you.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Please build a life of virtue such that you can face that day without regrets.」
			SETBIT CFLAG:1803, 1
			GOTO IGNORE
		CASE 3
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDL You can erase her blackmail material on you in exchange for a blow from the Rod of Remorse.
			PRINTFORMDL The choices above correspond to "Accept", "Postpone", and "Do not display this choice again".
			PRINTFORMDL In the worst case, the blow may leave you with no stamina and force the day to end early.
			PRINTFORML 
			PRINTFORMDL Postponing or ignoring will result in some negative-sounding dialogue.
			PRINTFORMDL However, there are no real penalties for doing so.
			PRINTFORMW 
			PRINTFORML 「...Well? Have you remembered what you have done?」
	ENDSELECT
	GOTO INPUT_LOOP
ELSE
	$IGNORE
	PRINTFORMDW By listening to her lecture, your Favor and Trust with Eiki has increased a \@ RESULT ? tiny # little \@ bit.
	LOCAL = RESULT
	CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(2, TARGET, RAND:5 + 7 - RESULT)
	CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(4, TARGET, RAND:3 + 3 - RESULT)
	SELECTCASE RAND:3
		CASE 0
			LOCALS = A considerate 
		CASE 1
			LOCALS = A useful 
		CASE 2
			LOCALS = A meaningful 
	ENDSELECT
	CALL RECOVER(MASTER, -100, "気力", @"%LOCALS% but long lecture")
	SOURCE:反感 = 0
	SOURCE:鬱屈 = 0
	SOURCE:歓楽 += ABL:30:親密 * 50
	SOURCE:情愛 += 1500
	RETURN LOCAL
ENDIF
RETURN 1

